{2}
' with ({1} = $QualifiedName, {2} = $ValidationMessage);
          @position(-654, 732)
          @anchor(to: top)
          return true;
        end if;
      else
        @position(-997, 622)
        @anchor(from: bottom, to: top)
        log warning node @AgentEditorCommons.LogNode 'No valid value could be found for the local configuration for the constant selected for Knowledge base Document ''{1}''. The Knowledge base could not be imported and updated in the app.
In order to make use of the Knowledge base in the current app runtime and in the playground in Studio Pro, make sure to configure a valid value.' with ({1} = $QualifiedName);
        @position(-997, 732)
        @anchor(to: top)
